WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.372 --> 00:00:05.339
&gt;&gt; Dana: BORDER PATROL

00:00:05.373 --> 00:00:06.008
&gt;&gt; Dana: BORDER PATROL

00:00:06.019 --> 00:00:07.624
OFFICIALS TELL FOX NEWS A

00:00:07.635 --> 00:00:08.928
MAJORITY OF ASYLUM SEEKERS AT

00:00:08.930 --> 00:00:09.956
THE SOUTHERN BORDER ARE BEING

00:00:09.967 --> 00:00:11.290
RETURNED TO MEXICO.

00:00:11.301 --> 00:00:13.309
THAT’S AFTER THE SUPREME COURT

00:00:13.344 --> 00:00:15.313
ORDERED LAST MONTH THE TRUMP

00:00:15.324 --> 00:00:17.228
ERA POLICY BE REINSTATED.

00:00:17.262 --> 00:00:19.444
JONATHAN HUNT IS LIVE IN

00:00:19.445 --> 00:00:21.397
LEHOYA, TEXAS TO CATCH US UP.

00:00:21.408 --> 00:00:24.187
&gt;&gt; WE’RE TRYING TO GET OFFICIAL

00:00:24.198 --> 00:00:25.451
WORD FROM EITHER THE DEPARTMENT

00:00:25.462 --> 00:00:27.118
OF HOMELAND SECURITY OR THE

00:00:27.129 --> 00:00:29.498
WHITE HOUSE AS TO WHETHER THERE

00:00:29.509 --> 00:00:31.361
HAS BEEN A FORMAL ORDER SINCE

00:00:31.394 --> 00:00:32.677
THAT SUPREME COURT RULING SENT

00:00:32.688 --> 00:00:34.499
DOWN TO BORDER PATROL AGENTS.

00:00:34.510 --> 00:00:37.542
AS YOU LOOK AT PICTURES OF

00:00:37.543 --> 00:00:38.940
FAMILIES ARRIVING HERE IN LA

00:00:38.975 --> 00:00:41.153
JOLLA, EARLY SUNDAY EVENING I

00:00:41.164 --> 00:00:44.766
CAN TELL YOU AT LEAST ONE

00:00:44.777 --> 00:00:46.431
BORDER PATROL SUPERVISOR IS

00:00:46.442 --> 00:00:48.126
TELLING US ALL FAMILIES ARE

00:00:48.137 --> 00:00:50.580
BEING SENT BACK UNLESS THEY

00:00:50.591 --> 00:00:52.641
HAVE A CHILD UNDER THE AGE OF 1.

00:00:52.675 --> 00:00:54.072
PREGNANT WOMEN ARE BEING

00:00:54.074 --> 00:00:56.727
ALLOWED TO STAY AS WELL BUT

00:00:56.738 --> 00:00:58.690
THAT IS ABOUT IT.

00:00:58.701 --> 00:01:00.798
ACCORDING TO THIS BORDER PATROL

00:01:00.809 --> 00:01:02.567
OFFICIAL, OTHERS ARE ALL BEING

00:01:02.600 --> 00:01:04.465
SENT BACK TO MEXICO IN THE WAKE

00:01:04.467 --> 00:01:05.811
OF THAT SUPREME COURT RULING.

00:01:05.822 --> 00:01:07.621
WHEN THEY GO BACK TO MEXICO,

00:01:07.632 --> 00:01:09.314
THEY ARE OFTEN IN THE CAMPS

00:01:09.325 --> 00:01:11.557
THAT WE HAVE SEEN FOR MANY

00:01:11.591 --> 00:01:13.758
MONTHS NOW JUST ON THE OTHER

00:01:13.769 --> 00:01:15.196
SIDE IN TIJUANA, THE CAMPS

00:01:15.230 --> 00:01:17.240
YOU’RE LOOKING AT NOW, FOR

00:01:17.241 --> 00:01:18.990
INSTANCE, UNDER WHAT WERE

00:01:19.001 --> 00:01:20.633
CALLED THE MIGRANT PROTECTION

00:01:20.644 --> 00:01:21.454
PROTOCOLS.

00:01:21.489 --> 00:01:23.783
THIS IS CAUSING SOME BLOWBACK

00:01:23.794 --> 00:01:24.758
FROM IMMIGRATION ADVOCACY

00:01:24.792 --> 00:01:25.294
GROUPS.

00:01:25.295 --> 00:01:27.761
A WHOLE SLOUGH OF THEM SENT A

00:01:27.772 --> 00:01:29.200
LETTER TO THE MEXICAN PRESIDENT

00:01:29.201 --> 00:01:31.289
SAYING THAT HE SHOULD STAND UP

00:01:31.290 --> 00:01:33.147
TO THE BIDEN ADMINISTRATION IF

00:01:33.148 --> 00:01:34.693
THEY DO REINSTATE THE REMAIN IN

00:01:34.704 --> 00:01:35.914
MEXICO POLICY.

00:01:35.915 --> 00:01:38.012
THE LETTER SAYS IN PART QUOTE,

00:01:38.023 --> 00:01:40.155
AS A SOVEREIGN NATION MEXICO

00:01:40.189 --> 00:01:42.543
HAS THE RIGHT TO REJECT THE

00:01:42.554 --> 00:01:44.579
REINSTATEMENT OF MPP OR ANY

00:01:44.590 --> 00:01:46.637
FUTURE ITERATION TO THIS POLICY

00:01:46.648 --> 00:01:48.859
THAT AIMS TO EXTERNALIZE THE

00:01:48.893 --> 00:01:50.499
U.S. BORDER INTO MEXICAN

00:01:50.510 --> 00:01:50.957
TERRITORY.

00:01:50.959 --> 00:01:53.080
IT IS IMPOSSIBLE TO REIMPLEMENT

00:01:53.091 --> 00:01:56.483
MPP IN A WAY THAT UPHOLDS HUMAN

00:01:56.516 --> 00:01:59.020
RIGHTS AND DUE PROCESS.

00:01:59.031 --> 00:02:00.682
AND MEXICO HAS THE

00:02:00.693 --> 00:02:01.757
RESPONSIBILITY TO BLOCK THIS

00:02:01.791 --> 00:02:02.747
DETRIMENTAL POLICY.

00:02:02.758 --> 00:02:05.566
NOW, IT IS TOO EARLY TO SAY, OF

00:02:05.568 --> 00:02:06.736
COURSE, AS APPREHENSIONS

00:02:06.747 --> 00:02:07.913
CONTINUE RIGHT ALONG THE MEXICO

00:02:07.946 --> 00:02:08.632
BORDER.

00:02:08.643 --> 00:02:11.392
THIS VIDEO YOU ARE LOOKING AT

00:02:11.426 --> 00:02:13.578
NOW IN LAREDO, TEXAS, TOO EARLY

00:02:13.589 --> 00:02:15.265
TO SAY WHETHER IF INDEED THOSE

00:02:15.276 --> 00:02:16.453
MIGRANT FAMILIES ARE BEING

00:02:16.464 --> 00:02:19.716
RETURNED IN GREATER NUMBERS TO

00:02:19.750 --> 00:02:21.602
MEXICO, WHETHER THAT WILL HAVE

00:02:21.613 --> 00:02:23.592
AN EFFECT IN PERHAPS DISSUEDING

00:02:23.625 --> 00:02:25.060
SOME TO TRY CROSSING THE BORDER

00:02:25.061 --> 00:02:25.640
ILLEGALLY.

00:02:25.641 --> 00:02:28.637
WE’RE DUE TO GET NEW FIGURES

00:02:28.648 --> 00:02:30.451
FOR AUGUST AT LEAST, DANA, FROM

00:02:30.485 --> 00:02:31.457
CUSTOMS AND BORDER PROTECTION

00:02:31.458 --> 00:02:32.367
PROBABLY AROUND THE END OF THIS

00:02:32.378 --> 00:02:32.933
WEEK.

00:02:32.944 --> 00:02:35.927
THAT WILL GIVE US THE TOTAL TO

00:02:35.960 --> 00:02:37.221
THE NUMBER OF ENCOUNTERS IN

00:02:37.232 --> 00:02:38.321
AUGUST.

00:02:38.332 --> 00:02:41.559
REMEMBER, IN JULY WE HAD A

00:02:41.593 --> 00:02:42.224
RECORD 212,000.

00:02:42.235 --> 00:02:43.917
I WOULD SAY WE MIGHT BE

00:02:43.928 --> 00:02:45.667
SLIGHTLY BELOW THAT BUT WE’RE

00:02:45.678 --> 00:02:48.556
ONLY IN ONE AREA OF THE BORDER.

00:02:48.567 --> 00:02:50.182
WE CAN’T SEE THE BIGGER PICTURE.

00:02:50.193 --> 00:02:52.036
BUT IT ISS GOING TO BE VERY

00:02:52.047 --> 00:02:53.443
INTERESTING TO SEE WHAT THE

00:02:53.454 --> 00:02:54.403
AUGUST FIGURES ARE.

00:02:54.437 --> 00:02:55.343
&gt;&gt; Dana: IT DIDN’T SLOW DOWN IN

